WEBVTT

00:06.880 --> 00:08.460
[Emma's mother] <i>Listen, Emma.</i>

00:09.210 --> 00:13.130
-I have to go very, very far away now.
-[♪ soft music]

00:13.800 --> 00:16.890
So I want you to live with your grandpa.

00:17.430 --> 00:19.350
[Emma] <i>When I saw Mommy for the last time,</i>

00:19.430 --> 00:23.180
<i>her lips were redder than usual
and she smelled like flowers.</i>

00:24.230 --> 00:25.940
When will you come for me?

00:26.020 --> 00:27.900
When I'm done with my business.

00:29.980 --> 00:33.360
[Emma] <i>Mommy, the truth is, I knew</i>

00:34.280 --> 00:35.660
<i>your true feelings.</i>

00:37.410 --> 00:38.910
SANO DOJO

00:38.990 --> 00:40.990
[shouts]
Everyone, get in here!

00:41.080 --> 00:42.580
[Grandpa] Shinichiro!

00:42.660 --> 00:44.620
Why are you shouting, Grandpa?

00:44.710 --> 00:46.710
Manjiro! Emma!

00:46.790 --> 00:49.670
Starting today, you're siblings!

00:49.750 --> 00:50.880
Huh?

00:50.960 --> 00:53.590
Isn't she a foreigner?

00:53.670 --> 00:55.180
[Mikey] Emma is such a weird name.

00:55.880 --> 00:57.180
[grunts]

00:57.260 --> 01:00.010
-[Grandpa] Make sure you all get along.
-[laughs]

01:00.100 --> 01:03.140
Manjiro, you just don't get girls, do you?

01:03.220 --> 01:06.560
Okay, Emma. I'll take you out somewhere.

01:07.100 --> 01:09.360
I know I'm handsome,
but don't fall for me.

01:09.440 --> 01:11.070
What a weird haircut.

01:11.150 --> 01:12.530
[awkward grunt]

01:12.610 --> 01:14.940
[muffled laugh]
I can tell that hurt.

01:15.030 --> 01:17.240
You're the one who doesn't get girls.

01:17.320 --> 01:18.410
[Shinichiro] Shut up!

01:18.490 --> 01:21.370
[kids grunting loudly]

01:25.370 --> 01:26.960
That's enough!

01:27.460 --> 01:28.580
[all panting]

01:28.670 --> 01:30.340
-[Shinichiro] Keisuke.
-Huh?

01:30.790 --> 01:33.460
You're just a kid, but you're strong.

01:33.550 --> 01:34.880
Shinichiro!

01:34.960 --> 01:36.880
[Shinichiro] Hey, don't shout!

01:36.970 --> 01:39.090
-Shinichiro!
-[Shinichiro grunts]

01:39.180 --> 01:41.550
[Grandpa]
That punk is always up to no good.

01:41.640 --> 01:43.720
He never comes to practice.

01:43.810 --> 01:46.180
Keisuke, don't you be like him.

01:46.730 --> 01:47.810
-Yes, sir.
-[thuds]

01:47.890 --> 01:48.900
[all] Huh?

01:55.860 --> 01:56.950
[Mikey grunts]

02:03.830 --> 02:05.700
[Emma] <i>Wow!</i>

02:05.790 --> 02:10.830
Sensei, how come he's so good
even though he hardly ever practices?

02:10.920 --> 02:12.210
He's a genius.

02:12.290 --> 02:15.050
What? That's not fair! How come?

02:15.130 --> 02:17.880
Because he's my grandson.

02:18.380 --> 02:21.050
Hey, Sano. Spar with me.

02:21.140 --> 02:23.760
Huh? No way. I don't want to get sweaty.

02:23.850 --> 02:25.930
[Baji] Then why are you at the dojo?

02:26.020 --> 02:28.980
Because I want to show off
and get noticed.

02:29.060 --> 02:31.900
What kind of stuck-up attitude is that?

02:31.980 --> 02:33.440
-[floor creaks]
-Huh?

02:33.520 --> 02:35.150
[soft gasp]

02:37.110 --> 02:38.820
By the way, who's she?

02:38.900 --> 02:40.740
Emma, my little sis.

02:42.320 --> 02:44.950
[Baji]
Really? So you've got different moms?

02:45.030 --> 02:46.910
[birds chirping]

02:47.000 --> 02:50.620
-Emma sounds like a foreign name.
-Totally.

02:50.710 --> 02:52.880
[Emma] <i>They share one brain cell.</i>

02:53.250 --> 02:55.590
Then I'll call myself Ed,
short for Edward.

02:55.670 --> 02:58.050
I'll call myself Mikey, short for Michael.

02:58.130 --> 02:59.510
[in English] This is a pen.

02:59.590 --> 03:01.010
I have a shit.

03:01.090 --> 03:02.470
[Baji and Mikey] Oh, my god!

03:02.550 --> 03:03.640
[both laugh]

03:03.800 --> 03:05.640
[Baji and Mikey] Oh, my god!

03:05.720 --> 03:07.560
[laughing continues]

03:08.390 --> 03:09.770
[both] Oh?

03:10.520 --> 03:13.350
[Emma in Japanese] The truth is, I know

03:13.440 --> 03:15.150
how Mommy feels.

03:17.360 --> 03:19.690
Mommy hates me.

03:19.780 --> 03:20.860
[both] Hmm?

03:21.910 --> 03:25.330
[Emma] I know that's why she abandoned me.

03:26.490 --> 03:29.040
But she told me…
[sobs]

03:29.120 --> 03:32.170
…she'd come back for me
when she finished her business.

03:33.670 --> 03:37.090
[Emma] She told me that.
[sobbing]

03:38.460 --> 03:40.050
[Grandpa] How's Emma doing?

03:40.130 --> 03:42.970
It looks like
she's getting used to things here.

03:43.380 --> 03:46.350
But I think she's just acting
like everything's fine.

03:46.430 --> 03:47.680
I see.

03:49.640 --> 03:51.730
I'd like to make her smile.

03:51.810 --> 03:53.600
[Grandpa] Same here.

03:53.690 --> 03:55.150
Huh…

03:55.770 --> 03:59.150
[grunting loudly]

04:00.320 --> 04:01.820
[Mikey] You're not doing it right.

04:03.780 --> 04:05.280
Want me to spar with you?

04:05.370 --> 04:06.410
[Emma] Hmph.

04:09.290 --> 04:11.750
Starting today, I'm Mikey.

04:13.210 --> 04:14.210
Huh?

04:15.460 --> 04:19.380
If your brother is named Mikey,
we'd be the same, so it won't be weird.

04:20.420 --> 04:23.300
From now on, I'll always be Mikey, Emma.

04:23.380 --> 04:24.720
[Emma gasping]

04:24.800 --> 04:27.640
-[sobbing softly]
-[♪ soft music]

04:28.680 --> 04:31.470
You just don't get girls, do you?

04:31.560 --> 04:32.560
[Mikey] Huh?

04:33.390 --> 04:35.440
It's not my name that bothers me.

04:36.020 --> 04:37.810
Oh, you smiled.

04:38.820 --> 04:40.150
Don't fall for me.

04:40.400 --> 04:41.400
[Emma] As if.

04:41.900 --> 04:44.150
Neither of you are my type.

04:44.950 --> 04:46.160
[giggles]

04:46.240 --> 04:47.450
[Emma] <i>But…</i>

04:51.040 --> 04:52.910
[Emma] Sorry. Did you wait long?

04:53.830 --> 04:58.630
<i>But since then,
I've never once felt lonely.</i>

05:00.960 --> 05:02.420
[crow cawing]

05:08.720 --> 05:10.100
[Inui] Taiju has retired.

05:11.220 --> 05:14.230
BLACK DRAGON will come
under Toman's command.

05:15.940 --> 05:19.110
Are you going to take over
as BLACK DRAGON's 11th leader?

05:19.520 --> 05:20.520
No.

05:20.610 --> 05:22.780
I won't be the 11th leader.

05:23.360 --> 05:25.320
I nominate Takemichi Hanagaki.

05:25.400 --> 05:27.910
Huh? Takemitchy?

05:27.990 --> 05:32.410
I saw a hint of our first leader
in Hanagaki when he faced Taiju.

05:32.490 --> 05:33.750
-[grunts]
-[wind gusting]

05:34.580 --> 05:38.370
He's got the potential
to lead BLACK DRAGON.

05:38.460 --> 05:41.040
[♪ ominous music]

05:43.550 --> 05:44.550
-[Mikey] No.
-[♪ music stops]

05:44.880 --> 05:47.090
Huh? "No"?

05:47.970 --> 05:51.510
Of course,
I'm not poaching Hanagaki from Toman.

05:51.600 --> 05:53.100
He'd still lead First Division…

05:53.180 --> 05:54.310
Hey.

05:54.390 --> 05:57.190
-It wasn't you who discovered Takemitchy.
-[♪ tense music]

05:57.270 --> 05:58.390
Uh… huh?

05:58.480 --> 05:59.480
It was me!

06:00.100 --> 06:01.360
-Uh…
-[Mikey grunts]

06:02.570 --> 06:04.480
[Mikey] The same potential as my brother?

06:04.570 --> 06:07.320
Anyway, he's mine, so you can't have him.

06:07.400 --> 06:10.160
[Inui] <i>Wait, is he getting jealous?</i>

06:10.570 --> 06:11.780
But…

06:11.870 --> 06:15.660
if Takemitchy absolutely insists
on being BLACK DRAGON's leader,

06:15.750 --> 06:17.660
I'll think about it.

06:17.750 --> 06:19.500
But only if he absolutely insists.

06:20.960 --> 06:22.460
[soft chuckle]

06:23.710 --> 06:25.420
[Inui] <i>Who'd have thought</i>

06:25.920 --> 06:29.090
<i>the day would come
when I'd wear this uniform.</i>

06:30.470 --> 06:33.180
[suspenseful sting]

06:34.560 --> 06:36.270
Mucho double-crossed us, huh?

06:36.770 --> 06:37.770
Yes.

06:38.560 --> 06:40.440
In this fight,

06:40.520 --> 06:43.150
First Division will do everything we can
to rescue Hajime Kokonoi.

06:43.230 --> 06:44.570
Good.

06:44.650 --> 06:49.700
Inui, if Tenjiku were to attack us
in earnest, when would it be?

06:50.490 --> 06:53.200
Tomorrow, February 22.

06:53.780 --> 06:57.160
[Inui] That's the day
BLACK DRAGON was founded 11 years ago.

06:58.580 --> 07:02.170
If Izana is that devoted
to Shinichiro Sano,

07:02.250 --> 07:03.880
then tomorrow is a special day.

07:04.380 --> 07:06.050
You think they'll attack tomorrow?

07:06.130 --> 07:08.510
Yes, no doubt about it.

07:08.590 --> 07:10.050
-Okay!
-[wind gusting]

07:10.130 --> 07:11.680
[Mikey] Gather all members of Toman.

07:12.300 --> 07:13.890
To prepare for tomorrow's showdown,

07:14.510 --> 07:15.890
we'll rally the troops!

07:15.970 --> 07:16.970
[gang members] Yes, sir!

07:18.930 --> 07:20.230
[footsteps approaching]

07:20.310 --> 07:21.350
[Kakucho shouts]
Izana!

07:22.020 --> 07:23.270
I'm against this!

07:23.350 --> 07:24.730
Shut it, Kakucho.

07:25.400 --> 07:27.530
This is the only way to crush Toman.

07:27.610 --> 07:31.700
Do you have any idea
what you're about to do?

07:32.700 --> 07:34.950
-[Izana] It won't be a problem.
-[surprised grunt]

07:35.530 --> 07:36.780
I…

07:37.450 --> 07:39.200
will never condone

07:40.290 --> 07:41.370
murder!

07:43.330 --> 07:45.380
[ambulance siren blaring]

07:53.930 --> 07:57.390
[Draken] The emergency meeting
before we face Tenjiku will now begin!

07:58.930 --> 08:00.430
-Chifuyu.
-[Chifuyu] Hmm?

08:01.140 --> 08:05.310
First Division's mission in this battle
is to rescue Koko.

08:06.060 --> 08:08.400
That and to defeat Kisaki and Izana.

08:08.480 --> 08:12.030
So basically, to crush Tenjiku.

08:12.110 --> 08:13.110
Right.

08:13.990 --> 08:18.410
That makes this seem like
our most straightforward fight yet.

08:18.490 --> 08:19.740
But the problem is

08:19.830 --> 08:22.910
whether Toman can defeat Tenjiku
the way we are now.

08:23.000 --> 08:24.000
Huh?

08:24.370 --> 08:26.130
Listen carefully, men.

08:26.210 --> 08:30.170
February 22, today,
Tenjiku will make its move.

08:30.590 --> 08:31.880
It's an all-out fight.

08:32.800 --> 08:34.430
[Draken] Stay focused when you fight.

08:34.930 --> 08:38.430
Those Tenjiku bastards won't fight fair.

08:38.930 --> 08:43.520
They call themselves a criminal syndicate
and will gladly fight dirty.

08:44.600 --> 08:47.190
-[Hakkai] Then Toman should too!
-[surprised grunt]

08:47.270 --> 08:49.570
Let's fight dirty and crush them!

08:50.070 --> 08:51.230
Hakkai?

08:51.320 --> 08:55.450
-Taka got jumped, and Smiley too.
-What?

08:55.530 --> 08:56.910
[both grunt]

08:56.990 --> 08:58.120
-You're kidding!
-[gang members exclaim]

08:58.200 --> 08:59.700
-How'd they take out those two?
-[♪ tense music]

08:59.780 --> 09:02.870
On their way here, some assholes
rammed into them on their bikes.

09:03.410 --> 09:05.920
When they were on the ground,
they beat them with steel pipes.

09:06.000 --> 09:07.000
Where are they now?

09:07.790 --> 09:09.460
[Hakkai] I took them to the hospital…

09:10.500 --> 09:12.460
<i>but they're both still out cold.</i>

09:13.460 --> 09:16.340
Those Tenjiku bastards will use
every dirty trick.

09:16.430 --> 09:18.300
[all grunt]

09:18.390 --> 09:20.720
If we don't do anything, Toman will lose!

09:21.350 --> 09:22.390
[Takemichi grunts]

09:23.310 --> 09:24.480
Look!

09:25.430 --> 09:27.020
[Hakkai] First Division's all beat-up.

09:27.100 --> 09:29.770
We've lost the captains
of Second and Fourth Divisions.

09:29.860 --> 09:32.020
Third Division's Captain is not with us.

09:32.530 --> 09:35.240
And those Fifth Division traitors
are with Tenjiku now.

09:35.900 --> 09:37.070
[Takemichi] <i>He's right.</i>

09:37.150 --> 09:39.410
<i>Most of the captains are out.</i>

09:39.870 --> 09:42.080
<i>Toman's in tatters now.</i>

09:42.160 --> 09:43.660
Hakkai's totally right.

09:43.740 --> 09:45.500
If we fight fair now, we'll lose.

09:45.580 --> 09:47.250
We should do the same as Tenjiku!

09:47.330 --> 09:49.750
-Let's get weapons and ambush them!
-[all] Yeah!

09:49.830 --> 09:51.670
[engine revs]

09:52.590 --> 09:53.880
Peh-yan.

09:53.960 --> 09:56.220
Shut the hell up, you wusses.

09:56.300 --> 09:58.510
Don't get your shorts in a knot.

09:59.930 --> 10:02.930
[Peh-yan] Are you so scared to lose
that you'd ambush them with weapons?

10:04.270 --> 10:05.350
Pah-chin…

10:06.600 --> 10:08.600
<i>got arrested for using a weapon.</i>

10:10.400 --> 10:13.070
I attacked Draken over a misunderstanding.

10:14.280 --> 10:16.240
<i>I fought dirty.</i>

10:18.280 --> 10:20.780
Even so, this is what Mikey said to me.

10:21.950 --> 10:24.330
-"I don't want to fight you."
-[♪ melancholic music]

10:25.290 --> 10:27.160
[Peh-yan] That's why I'm still here.

10:28.120 --> 10:29.210
That's why

10:29.670 --> 10:33.920
this time, I want to fight legit,
in a way Mikey'd approve!

10:34.000 --> 10:35.130
[Takemichi grunts]

10:35.960 --> 10:37.590
[all grunt]

10:37.670 --> 10:39.300
-[Peh-yan] Hakkai!
-Huh?

10:39.380 --> 10:42.470
I know you're freaked out
over Mitsuya and Smiley getting beat,

10:43.100 --> 10:44.180
but look at Mikey.

10:44.680 --> 10:46.640
[wind gusting]

10:47.640 --> 10:48.980
Is he smiling?

10:50.100 --> 10:52.190
[wind gusting]

10:54.070 --> 10:55.070
[soft gasp]

10:55.860 --> 10:56.860
Hakkai.

10:57.230 --> 10:59.610
You stay with Mitsuya and Smiley.

10:59.700 --> 11:01.860
What? Wait!

11:01.950 --> 11:03.070
I want to avenge Taka!

11:03.530 --> 11:06.870
It's not because I'm worried
about Mitsuya and Smiley's condition.

11:08.330 --> 11:09.460
Those guys,

11:10.500 --> 11:13.580
when they wake up,
they'll want to join this fight for sure.

11:14.590 --> 11:15.960
Keep them out of it.

11:16.050 --> 11:17.130
[gasps]

11:18.340 --> 11:21.510
First Division,
you carry out your mission.

11:21.590 --> 11:22.840
Yes, sir.

11:23.720 --> 11:24.850
[Mikey] Listen up, men!

11:25.390 --> 11:28.810
Not a single captain will have your back
in this fight.

11:30.140 --> 11:31.270
I'm all you need!

11:32.020 --> 11:34.360
-[all gasp]
-[♪ dramatic music]

11:35.190 --> 11:36.400
[Takemichi] <i>That's right!</i>

11:36.900 --> 11:39.190
<i>We've got Mikey!</i>

11:40.570 --> 11:42.200
Let's crush Tenjiku!

11:42.280 --> 11:45.120
[all shout]

11:46.660 --> 11:48.540
SANO FAMILY GRAVE

11:48.620 --> 11:50.410
[birds chirping]

11:52.290 --> 11:53.500
Shinichiro.

11:54.540 --> 11:59.130
This is the 11th leader of BLACK DRAGON,
Takemichi Hanagaki.

12:00.760 --> 12:04.510
I'll make a great gang
that won't disgrace our founder.

12:07.100 --> 12:09.470
[Izana]
So BLACK DRAGON gets their 11th leader

12:09.560 --> 12:11.730
on the day it was founded, huh?

12:11.810 --> 12:13.190
[gasps]

12:13.770 --> 12:15.350
FIRST GENERATION TENJIKU

12:15.440 --> 12:16.690
[Izana] Isn't that nice?

12:17.310 --> 12:19.730
-So you're Takemichi Hanagaki.
-[♪ tense music]

12:20.570 --> 12:22.530
[Takemichi] <i>Who the heck is this guy?</i>

12:22.610 --> 12:23.780
[shouts]
Izana!

12:23.860 --> 12:24.860
[Takemichi grunts]

12:24.950 --> 12:28.410
[Takemichi]
<i>This is Izana Kurokawa of the past?</i>

12:29.030 --> 12:32.500
What the hell are you planning to do
with Koko, damn it?

12:32.580 --> 12:33.580
Now, now.

12:34.330 --> 12:35.960
I'm not planning anything.

12:36.460 --> 12:38.630
He joined us out of his own free will.

12:38.710 --> 12:40.550
[breathes angrily]

12:40.630 --> 12:41.670
[Izana] Let go of me.

12:41.760 --> 12:44.550
I've only come
to pay my respects to my brother.

12:44.630 --> 12:46.680
Hey, Inupi…

12:46.760 --> 12:48.930
Now that we've got Kokonoi,

12:49.510 --> 12:52.060
I couldn't care less about you, Inui.

12:52.930 --> 12:54.020
[Inui] Why you!

12:54.100 --> 12:56.230
-[Mikey] Don't do it, Inupi.
-[Inui and Takemichi grunt]

12:56.310 --> 12:57.690
[Takemichi] Mikey!

12:58.360 --> 12:59.770
Huh? What's going on?

13:00.270 --> 13:01.480
Mikey…

13:02.190 --> 13:05.650
Well, well. Brother and sister
paying their respects, huh?

13:06.280 --> 13:07.660
[Emma] Huh?

13:07.740 --> 13:08.740
[Izana scoffs]

13:09.700 --> 13:10.870
[Inui grunts]

13:13.410 --> 13:15.540
[Takemichi]
<i>I think something's going to go down.</i>

13:16.370 --> 13:19.290
Takemitchy, get Emma away from here.

13:20.380 --> 13:21.960
[motorbike engine rumbles]

13:24.760 --> 13:27.970
It's not like you
to get your own hands dirty.

13:28.050 --> 13:29.140
Yeah.

13:30.470 --> 13:32.930
I can't leave this up to anyone else.

13:36.270 --> 13:39.940
That guy is my other older brother.

13:40.020 --> 13:41.360
[Takemichi grunts softly]

13:42.230 --> 13:43.360
[Emma] Izana, right?

13:44.240 --> 13:45.950
So that's what he's like.

13:47.400 --> 13:50.780
I was really little when we were together.

13:50.870 --> 13:52.330
I don't remember much of him.

13:52.910 --> 13:54.370
Tonight at 8 p.m.,

13:54.660 --> 13:57.830
come with all of Toman
to Yokohama's Seventh Pier.

13:59.250 --> 14:02.210
[Izana]
Let's put an end to all of this, Mikey.

14:03.050 --> 14:05.170
They're going to fight soon, right?

14:05.670 --> 14:06.880
[Takemichi] Probably.

14:06.970 --> 14:08.130
But they're brothers.

14:09.800 --> 14:11.050
[Takemichi] <i>She's right.</i>

14:11.640 --> 14:13.140
<i>Why has it come to this?</i>

14:14.180 --> 14:17.230
[Emma] How come boys always have to fight?

14:17.310 --> 14:18.310
[Takemichi] Huh?

14:19.060 --> 14:22.480
[Emma] "The invincible Mikey,
leader of the Tokyo Manji Gang."

14:23.110 --> 14:26.240
Mikey always puts on
a strong front around others.

14:26.320 --> 14:28.070
[♪ melancholic music]

14:28.150 --> 14:29.570
When Shinichiro died too.

14:30.070 --> 14:31.820
And when Baji died.

14:32.530 --> 14:36.000
Mikey never shows his weakness.

14:37.080 --> 14:38.370
Not to anyone.

14:38.460 --> 14:39.790
You're right.

14:41.130 --> 14:42.960
But the truth is,

14:43.590 --> 14:47.260
even now, he can't sleep
without his worn-out blanket.

14:48.050 --> 14:49.430
He's a weak little boy.

14:49.510 --> 14:50.510
[Takemichi grunts]

14:50.970 --> 14:52.510
Just like you and me.

14:54.050 --> 14:56.520
Starting today, I'm Mikey.

14:57.930 --> 15:01.270
So if he ever snaps under the strain…

15:02.060 --> 15:04.980
From now on, I'll always be Mikey, Emma.

15:05.480 --> 15:07.400
[sobbing softly]

15:08.940 --> 15:13.370
When that happens,
I swear I'll be there to save him.

15:14.780 --> 15:16.910
Just like Mikey was for me.

15:17.410 --> 15:18.750
[soft gasp]

15:18.830 --> 15:20.290
[Takemichi] <i>Now I get it.</i>

15:20.870 --> 15:24.040
I sounded too cool just now, didn't I?
[chuckles]

15:24.130 --> 15:26.460
[Takemichi]
<i>I think the one who understands</i>

15:26.550 --> 15:28.300
<i>and supports Mikey the most</i>

15:28.800 --> 15:30.670
<i>might just be Emma.</i>

15:32.050 --> 15:33.260
Huh?

15:34.140 --> 15:36.720
<i>Mikey turns evil in the future.</i>

15:37.220 --> 15:38.770
My life was…

15:39.600 --> 15:41.520
nothing but suffering.

15:43.350 --> 15:44.900
Even though he had Emma.

15:45.860 --> 15:47.650
Want something to drink?

15:47.730 --> 15:48.730
[Takemichi] Uh, sure.

15:48.820 --> 15:49.990
[soft chuckle]

15:51.150 --> 15:52.490
-Huh?
-[tense sting]

15:53.360 --> 15:54.570
[Takemichi] <i>Did Emma…</i>

15:55.070 --> 15:56.660
<i>exist in the future?</i>

15:56.740 --> 15:58.370
[motorbike engine revving]

15:58.450 --> 16:00.330
[wind gusting]

16:00.410 --> 16:02.710
Izana! Reconsider!

16:02.790 --> 16:04.750
Are you sure you want this?

16:05.750 --> 16:06.790
Yeah.

16:06.920 --> 16:08.050
[angry grunt]

16:09.920 --> 16:14.300
From now on,
become Mikey's emotional support.

16:16.680 --> 16:19.010
[♪ tense music]

16:19.100 --> 16:21.060
[Kisaki]
Total control is within your grasp.

16:21.140 --> 16:24.770
[Kisaki] <i>This will complete my own Toman.</i>

16:26.110 --> 16:27.900
[motorbike engine revving]

16:29.230 --> 16:30.610
[both] Huh?

16:30.690 --> 16:33.150
[♪ tense music continues]

16:34.910 --> 16:36.780
[grunting loudly]

16:36.870 --> 16:38.490
[gasps]
Kisaki!

16:40.370 --> 16:41.700
[grunts, gasps]

16:43.500 --> 16:44.830
-[bat clanks]
-[♪ music stops]

16:49.630 --> 16:50.750
[body thuds]

16:52.550 --> 16:55.220
[breathing shakily]

16:58.930 --> 16:59.930
[Takemichi] <i>Huh?</i>

17:01.720 --> 17:02.730
<i>What was that?</i>

17:06.560 --> 17:07.650
<i>What just happened?</i>

17:09.570 --> 17:11.780
[Takemichi breathing shakily]

17:13.440 --> 17:14.450
Emma?

17:14.990 --> 17:15.990
[gasps]

17:18.070 --> 17:20.490
[motorbike engine rumbles]

17:22.370 --> 17:24.200
[breathing shakily]

17:24.290 --> 17:26.790
[Takemichi] <i>You can't be serious, Kisaki.</i>

17:28.420 --> 17:31.050
<i>You went after Emma?</i>

17:32.170 --> 17:34.670
It's over, Takemichi Hanagaki.

17:37.010 --> 17:39.340
-[tires screeching]
-[engine revving]

17:39.430 --> 17:41.470
[♪ eerie music]

17:42.390 --> 17:45.020
[Takemichi breathing shakily]

17:47.390 --> 17:50.650
[Takemichi] <i>He'd even attack a girl?</i>

17:51.480 --> 17:53.570
<i>To drag Mikey down,</i>

17:54.320 --> 17:56.320
<i>he'd do something this shitty?</i>

17:57.200 --> 17:58.200
[Takemichi] Emma…

17:59.280 --> 18:00.780
Emma!

18:00.870 --> 18:01.950
Emma!

18:04.160 --> 18:05.370
<i>I'm such an idiot!</i>

18:06.210 --> 18:10.380
<i>Even though I saved Draken
and got Kisaki kicked out of Toman,</i>

18:10.460 --> 18:13.630
<i>the reason nothing ever changed was </i>

18:14.090 --> 18:15.090
<i>because of this!</i>

18:16.920 --> 18:19.840
[Takemichi] Emma! Wake up, Emma!

18:20.300 --> 18:21.300
If you…

18:21.760 --> 18:24.350
If you die here in the past,
I can't save you.

18:24.430 --> 18:25.680
Emma!

18:26.640 --> 18:28.560
-[Mikey] Emma?
-[Takemichi gasps]

18:30.440 --> 18:31.480
[Takemichi grunts]

18:35.230 --> 18:38.320
[voice breaking]
I'm sorry, Mikey.

18:38.400 --> 18:39.610
I…

18:39.700 --> 18:41.280
What happened?

18:42.950 --> 18:44.080
A bike…

18:44.620 --> 18:48.120
A bike rode down on us, and Emma was…

18:49.830 --> 18:51.000
Kisaki did it.

18:51.670 --> 18:53.460
-[Mikey] What?
-[Inui gasps]

18:57.010 --> 18:58.010
An ambulance.

18:59.260 --> 19:01.590
The hospital's not far. Put her on me.

19:01.680 --> 19:03.350
I'll go on ahead and tell them.

19:10.190 --> 19:12.270
[Takemichi] <i>Please be all right, Emma.</i>

19:12.350 --> 19:13.480
<i>Please!</i>

19:15.070 --> 19:16.980
-Mikey…
-[gasps]

19:17.070 --> 19:18.570
[gasps]
Emma!

19:19.240 --> 19:22.610
Huh? I can't move.

19:23.070 --> 19:24.070
Huh?

19:25.280 --> 19:26.740
Oh, yeah…

19:27.290 --> 19:28.410
I was…

19:31.000 --> 19:33.380
[Mikey] Do you remember, Emma?

19:33.920 --> 19:37.090
-When you were five, you chased after me.
-[♪ somber music]

19:37.670 --> 19:40.130
You fell off the jungle gym
and broke your leg.

19:40.630 --> 19:44.180
I haven't given you
a piggyback ride since then.

19:44.260 --> 19:46.100
[Emma breathes shakily]
Hey…

19:46.470 --> 19:47.470
Yeah?

19:48.020 --> 19:50.640
[Emma] If anything happens to me…

19:50.730 --> 19:53.560
Don't be silly.
Nothing's going to happen to you.

19:54.940 --> 19:57.940
Tell Draken this for me.

19:58.940 --> 20:02.450
[Emma] "Ken, I love you."

20:02.950 --> 20:04.820
[stifled sobbing]

20:05.530 --> 20:06.830
Tell him yourself.

20:08.910 --> 20:10.450
Takemitchy…

20:10.830 --> 20:12.120
[gasps]
Yeah?

20:13.080 --> 20:15.130
Take care of…

20:15.670 --> 20:18.380
Mikey for me, okay?

20:19.500 --> 20:21.300
[Takemichi breathes shakily, sobs]

20:23.840 --> 20:24.930
[gasps]

20:25.010 --> 20:26.430
[gasps]

20:30.060 --> 20:32.270
Emma? Emma?

20:32.350 --> 20:35.940
I promised Draken I'd keep this a secret.

20:36.020 --> 20:38.860
[Mikey] But Draken loves you, you know.

20:39.360 --> 20:40.690
It's mutual.

20:40.780 --> 20:43.110
I'll call Draken
once we get to the hospital.

20:43.610 --> 20:45.240
Okay, Emma?

20:47.370 --> 20:48.620
Emma…

20:51.540 --> 20:52.620
[Mikey] Takemitchy.

20:53.120 --> 20:54.120
[Takemichi] Yes?

20:54.580 --> 20:57.920
[Mikey] Put my jacket over Emma.

20:58.000 --> 20:59.040
[Mikey inhales sharply]

21:00.840 --> 21:04.170
Emma is kind of cold somehow.

21:05.090 --> 21:06.090
[gulps]

21:06.760 --> 21:08.350
[voice breaking]
Mikey!

21:09.810 --> 21:10.890
It's my dream

21:12.020 --> 21:14.060
that you'll have a kid someday

21:15.270 --> 21:16.940
and you and Draken will have a house.

21:17.440 --> 21:18.810
And when I come over,

21:19.310 --> 21:21.690
Draken will totally ignore you.

21:22.190 --> 21:23.570
[Mikey] We'll drink and laugh

21:23.650 --> 21:26.700
over stories of the good old days
we've told a hundred times.

21:26.780 --> 21:28.120
Mikey!

21:28.200 --> 21:29.780
[Takemichi] <i>Emma's already…</i>

21:30.370 --> 21:32.160
I'd stay until late into the night.

21:33.040 --> 21:38.130
Eventually, we'd invite over Mitsuya
and Takemitchy and we'd have a blast.

21:39.500 --> 21:41.130
We'd wake up the baby,

21:41.500 --> 21:44.260
and you'd get really ticked off at me.

21:44.340 --> 21:46.800
[baby crying]

21:46.880 --> 21:48.550
-[Emma] Get back here!
-[scared grunt]

21:48.640 --> 21:50.350
[chuckles]
There they go again.

21:50.430 --> 21:52.180
[laughs]

21:52.260 --> 21:55.140
Quit laughing and do something, Draken!

21:55.230 --> 21:57.140
I said get back here, Mikey!

21:57.230 --> 21:58.560
[grunts]
Ow!

21:58.650 --> 22:01.150
[Draken chuckles]
<i>Emma, that's still got beer in it.</i>

22:01.230 --> 22:04.320
[Emma] <i>Oh, dear! That was dangerous!</i>

22:04.400 --> 22:06.820
-<i>It's all your fault, Mikey!</i>
-[laughter]

22:08.530 --> 22:10.660
[indistinct chatter and laughter
in vision continues]

22:10.740 --> 22:12.330
[Emma in vision] <i>Mikey!</i>

22:16.580 --> 22:18.580
[♪ closing theme music]

23:44.460 --> 23:46.460
Translated by Brian Athey
